+// This used to clear the timers WITHOUT running them, which abandoned the
+// remaining cards: the model held the full hand but the table showed fewer
+// cards than the evaluator had used. Now the outstanding pitches are placed
+// at once, in their original order, and the last one reconciles face state.
+// Purely visual catch-up — no poker logic runs, no card is drawn, no model
